s who have brains of humans and fangs of beasts. Hitomi is Ratel, a Brute with the strongest killer instinct. Nomoto gets involved in their battles called Killing Bites.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/iupmoMQ1iWQRLEBOIqRTZTdxE69.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 1","synopsis":"Yuya Nomoto, an ordinary college student, met a mysterious high-school student called Hitomi after being involved in an incident, and saw her transform into a beast and fight a Leo monster at a landfill. They're Therianthropes who have brains of humans and fangs of beasts. Hitomi is Ratel, a Brute with the strongest killer instinct. Nomoto gets involved in their battles called Killing Bites.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/iupmoMQ1iWQRLEBOIqRTZTdxE69.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 2","episodeNumber":2,"sourceEpisodeNumber":2,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"12888","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"98389","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"mal","id":"34964","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"76130","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"337939","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[2]}],"link":"2469","synopsis":"Nomoto, whom became the player for Ratel, got attacked that night by Rowdy. Rowdy tries to get information about Ratel from Nomoto, but Hitomi appeared, and it turned into a battle between Ratel and Rowdy. Nomoto is also targeted by Rowdy during that battle, but then, Okajima, the Giant, appeared. And Okajima, whom saved Nomoto, asks Hitomi to do him a favor.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ltxvaBJCjG9FySzUrNUx28ACrx6.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 2","synopsis":"Nomoto, whom became the player for Ratel, got attacked that night by Rowdy. Rowdy tries to get information about Ratel from Nomoto, but Hitomi appeared, and it turned into a battle between Ratel and Rowdy. Nomoto is also targeted by Rowdy during that battle, but then, Okajima, the Giant, appeared. And Okajima, whom saved Nomoto, asks Hitomi to do him a favor.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ltxvaBJCjG9FySzUrNUx28ACrx6.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 3","episodeNumber":3,"sourceEpisodeNumber":3,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"12888","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"98389","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"mal","id":"34964","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"76130","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"337939","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[3]}],"link":"2470","synopsis":"Hitomi learns about Killing Bites Destroyal (a battle between the top four zaibatsu) after a cat fight with Eruza Nakanishi. Hitomi decides to enter the game as Ishida zaibatsu with Okajima, but the Destroyal is a team battle for teams of three. They need one more member, but they have difficulty finding that person. Meanwhile, Okajima gets in touch with Ui Inaba, who's a Therianthrope of Rabbit.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/1XcIPrQ91mAyCp8Vf8qys1ZkHAP.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 3","synopsis":"Hitomi learns about Killing Bites Destroyal (a battle between the top four zaibatsu) after a cat fight with Eruza Nakanishi. Hitomi decides to enter the game as Ishida zaibatsu with Okajima, but the Destroyal is a team battle for teams of three. They need one more member, but they have difficulty finding that person. Meanwhile, Okajima gets in touch with Ui Inaba, who's a Therianthrope of Rabbit.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/1XcIPrQ91mAyCp8Vf8qys1ZkHAP.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 4","episodeNumber":4,"sourceEpisodeNumber":4,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"