ition, but they experience a hard battle. On the other hand, it seemed like a clear victory for Tiger in the battle between him and the other three forces, but he was now in a tight spot due to the Sumitomo campâ€TMs plot. Then, Hippopotamus did something unexpected.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/wRUjGTUvy2G2Xo5sEWmQOIi8ZQT.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 7","episodeNumber":7,"sourceEpisodeNumber":7,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"12888","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"98389","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"mal","id":"34964","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"76130","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"337939","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]}],"link":"2474","synopsis":"After Tiger left, a battle between Crocodile and Hippopotamus was taking place. Mitsukado camp's Kido and the once defeated Yabe, a Therianthrope of Gorilla appears. Crocodile, who got his game cut short bare his fangs towards Kido. While that was going on, the battle between Cobra, Cheetah, and the team of Ratel and Gecko was getting especially intense.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/a3HM5pM5pn5ko2tCXnkdeOefOj1.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 7","synopsis":"After Tiger left, a battle between Crocodile and Hippopotamus was taking place. Mitsukado camp's Kido and the once defeated Yabe, a Therianthrope of Gorilla appears. Crocodile, who got his game cut short bare his fangs towards Kido. While that was going on, the battle between Cobra, Cheetah, and the team of Ratel and Gecko was getting especially intense.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/a3HM5pM5pn5ko2tCXnkdeOefOj1.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 8","episodeNumber":8,"sourceEpisodeNumber":8,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"12888","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"98389","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"mal","id":"34964","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"76130","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"337939","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]}],"link":"2475","synopsis":"Zaibatsu chairman, Mitsukado, and the other leaders of the top four zaibatsu were watching the game in the VIP room on the ship. The Destroyal was also a proxy war between the zaibatsu to decide who'd get the decision-making power for the theriomorphosis business which is likely to yield huge profits. On the island, Ratel and Cheetah were in an unthinkable state because of Civet's Civetone Trap.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/cxccsVieE2bUnuSvdvCSLqaMiNe.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 8","synopsis":"Zaibatsu chairman, Mitsukado, and the other leaders of the top four zaibatsu were watching the game in the VIP room on the ship. The Destroyal was also a proxy war between the zaibatsu to decide who'd get the decision-making power for the theriomorphosis business which is likely to yield huge profits. On the island, Ratel and Cheetah were in an unthinkable state because of Civet's Civetone Trap.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/cxccsVieE2bUnuSvdvCSLqaMiNe.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 9","episodeNumber":9,"sourceEpisodeNumber":9,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"12888","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"98389","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"mal","id":"34964","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"76130","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"337939","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]}],"link":"2476","synopsis":"Finally, the battle between Tiger and Ratel has begun. Ratel still rose up after Tiger's ki